> Hearkening back and argument I had with Jordan a month ago: now that I
> know what a collective is, and what piro is, I know how to say
> "severally", "together", and "is an emergent property".
>
> (1) The broda severally did brode:
>
> genai piro loi broda cu brode gi pisu'o loi broda cu brode
>
> (2) The broda together did brode:
>
> piro loi broda cu brode
>
> (3) brode is an emergent property of broda
>
> ge piro loi broda cu brode ginai pida'a loi broda cu brode
